    <Row Tag="LOC_JAC_AGE_DARK_CHOICE_BODY" Language="ja_JP"><Text>当家は暗黒期に入った。この期の間に1度だけ、暗黒期の政策を選び直せる。選ばなければ「{1_Policy}」のまま。</Text></Row>
    <Row Tag="LOC_JAC_AGE_DARK_CHOICE_BODY" Language="en_US"><Text>Your house is in a Dark Age. Once during this era you may choose its Dark Age policy; until then it keeps "{1_Policy}".</Text></Row>
